DTEND:20260805T223000
UID:c9e4aed12ec15732e5d944a80d243525@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:evidence is an experimental club series in toronto ontario. ev
 idence 3 seeks to restructure the format between club nights and live perf
 ormance experiences as the event series metamorphozies. upstairs is soga (
 mexico city hardcore punk)\, dermabrasion (toronto death rock)\, xodkaar (
 iran experimental)\, and david hodgson (NYC/toronto jazz saxophone). trust
 fall (freakers corner) will be guiding the night upstairs with downtempo i
 nto club explorations. downstairs starting late and ending later\, we&#x27
 \;d like to introduce to you our new resident dj/ performer KERUB. they wi
 ll be contributing and contextualizing all of our future events with no ba
 rriers. never know what to expect but come prepared for anything. particip
 ate in this evening like a show and watch the performers while socializing
  during the in between\, or like a club experience\, wandering and sociali
 zing during the performers\, or as a different thing\, what this is actual
 ly is. at jama\, the space that is the condensed version of actual known a
 nd unknown toronto. two floors. door tickets available\, but presales appr
 eciated. NOTAFLOF. come see the evidence. ‍
LOCATION:The Jama\, 961 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/evidence-3-feat-soga-cdmx-xodkaar-dermabra
 sion-kerub-david-hodgson-trustfall-at-jama
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Trivia Night
DTSTART:20260806T190000
DTEND:20260806T190000
UID:8bf8b40d60bb60e6cad22ac44b0acea4@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Ready to put your queer trivia skills to the test? Join Bridgi
 ng With Support for our Queer Trivia Night at Understory Café on Thursday
 \, August 6th at 7:00 PM! Whether you’re a trivia champion\, a casual pl
 ayer\, part of the 2SLGBTQIA+ community\, or an ally looking for a fun nig
 ht out\, we’d love to have you there. Everyone is welcome! ✨ Walk-in e
 vent 🎉 Free to attend 🏳️‍🌈 Inclusive and community-focused Ev
 ery gathering like this helps strengthen community connections while suppo
 rting BWS and @understorytoronto’s mission to make mental health care an
 d community building more accessible. 📍 Where: Understory Café (505 Ch
 urch St\, Toronto) 🗓 Thursday\, August 6 🕖 7:00 PM Bring your friend
 s\, meet new people\, grab a drink\, and celebrate community with us. As p
 art of creating a welcoming and inclusive community space\, we encourage a
 ttendees to show their support for Understory Café by ordering a drink du
 ring the event. As a trans-owned local business\, Understory plays an impo
 rtant role in fostering spaces where everyone can gather\, connect\, and c
 elebrate together. Whether you’re joining us for trivia\, catching up wi
 th friends\, or meeting new people\, grabbing a drink is a simple way to s
 upport a queer-owned establishment and help sustain the community spaces t
 hat bring us together. — #queertrivia #torontoevents #queermentalhealth 
 #trivianight #lgbtqmentalhealth ‍
LOCATION:Understory Cafe\, 505 Church St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-trivia-night-2
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Game Night
DTSTART:20260806T200000
DTEND:20260806T200000
UID:41b6e54dd1b9db18c06b42db280d0ed6@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Queer Game Night. Unlimited arcade and board game plus ice bre
 ak bingo! Oh hey\, gaymers... we’re back! 🌈 Ready to Come Out™ and 
 level up your fun IRL? 🎮🍻 Join us at FreePlay Toronto for our next Q
 ueer Game Night—a place to sip\, play\, and connect with friends old and
  new. Located on College Street\, FreePlay is a retro gaming haven where y
 our entry fee unlocks unlimited arcade games for the night! 🍸 Drinks\, 
 Games &amp\; Good Vibes: Grab a drink\, share some snacks\, and dive into 
 the action! Challenge your crew (or meet new friends) with games like air 
 hockey\, Jenga\, Cards Against Humanity\, Uno\, and more. Don&#x27\;t forg
 et the icecream and slushies! 🎶 Icebreaker Activities: New to the scene
  or just want to meet some cool folks? We’ve got our icebreaker bingo ga
 me to make mingling fun and easy. Plus colour coded wristbands to make it 
 easy to spot who&#x27\;s single and who&#x27\;s looking for friends. 💥 
 Arcade &amp\; Board Game Fun: From nostalgic arcade classics to your favor
 ite board games\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy. 🕹️🎲
 ✨ Who’s ready to mingle? 📅 Date: Thursday\, August 6th 🕖 Time: 8
 pm - late 📍 Location: 300 College St\, Toronto 🎫 Early bird: $10 Gen
 eral Admission $15 ‍
LOCATION:Free Play\, 300 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-game-night-7
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
