DESCRIPTION:QUEER POOL AUGUST IS HERE! 🌈 Another Queer Pool edition is 
 here\, and this month we’ve got Levi behind the decks. 🔥 @djsarahlevi
  is bringing an incredible set to keep the dance floor moving all night lo
 ng. Come for a game of pool\, stay for the dance floor. Whether you’re l
 ooking to meet new people\, catch up with friends\, or dance until close\,
  this night is for you. This edition also comes with a little invitation t
 o our 30+ community. ❤️ This is not a 30+ only event. Everyone is welc
 ome\, as always. We simply want to encourage more folks in their 30s\, 40s
 \, 50s and beyond to come out\, connect with each other\, and enjoy a quee
 r night out. Queer Pool has always been about bringing our community toget
 her across generations\, and we’d love to see even more of that this mon
 th. Bring your friends\, challenge someone to a game\, grab a drink\, and 
 let’s make it another great night. August 18 6pm-Late 10$ Cash Only See 
 you at Rivoli! 🎱✨ #queerpoolnight #queerpoolclub #queerevents #toront
 oqueer #wlw ‍
LOCATION:The Rivoli\, 334 Queen Street West
