DTEND:20260819T190000
UID:8136705216a63b660c270f635e50ca05@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of nostalgia\, daydreaming\, and commun
 ity as we collage with an incredible collection of vintage magazines\, inc
 luding vintage Playboy issues plus current queer publications and other ic
 onic titles. This month&#x27\;s theme invites you to explore your timeless
  queer fantasy. Reimagine vintage imagery\, reclaim old narratives\, creat
 e the love story that never made it onto the page\, or simply enjoy the th
 rill of cutting into magazines from another era in a safe space that allow
 s you to explore yourself. Queer Collage Club is all about slowing down\, 
 making art\, and building community. Whether you come solo or with friends
 \, you&#x27\;ll find group activities\, photo opportunities\, featured dri
 nks at the bar\, and a room full of people creating\, connecting\, and sha
 ring the experience together. All materials are provided\, and no art expe
