BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Speed Dannecting
DTSTART:20260820T193000
DTEND:20260820T193000
UID:c7997393105417e804a69d1e8a6a6db4@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Is it speed dating? Is it quick connecting? Yes! QUEER SPEED D
 ANNECTING! Is it speed dating? Is it quick connecting? Yes! What is ‘spe
 ed dannecting’? Some people want to meet people with the possibility (bu
 t not pressure) of dating. Some people want to meet people with the possib
 ility of (but not pressure) of connections. So dating+connecting=dannectin
 g. ‘Dannecting’ is a fast way to meet new people -&gt\; lots of possib
 ilities but no pressure! How does it work? You will have short\, focused c
 onversations with 12 people in 75 minutes. You will have 6 minutes (3 minu
 tes each) to ask each other questions that we have provided for you - a mi
 x of light and more meaningful questions. You don’t need to plan any que
 stions - we got that covered! Also\, questions usually won’t repeat\, so
  your quick chats will stay fresh and interesting. At the end of the first
  75 minutes\, there will be 45 minutes of casual time for you to hang out 
 and have talks organically with some of the people you just met. We will h
 ave a few things out of the tables (cards\, colouring books\, puzzles) if 
 you want to do something together. How will you be matched up? We are expe
 cting 40-50 people at this event. This is our first time trying it\, so it
  will be an ‘everyone’ edition. Before the event\, you will be sent an
  optional questionnaire to complete. We will use that to try and make sure
  that at least half of your speed chats are with people who you have a hig
 her likelihood of having a match with. This first one costs $9 to attend\,
  with a few free spots. 7:30pm - Check-in 7:45pm - Speed Chats Start 9:00p
 m - Speed Chats End 9:10pm - Casual hanging out 9:45pm - End The entrance\
 , washrooms and space are wheelchair accessible. The space does not have a
  liquor license\, but sober drinks and snacks will be available at Glad Da
 y. ‍ ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
