  All trans\, non-binary and gender fluid folks welcome! Join us between tr
 ail 3 and 4 at Hanlans point beach on Aug 29th at 6:00pm. Look out for a k
 iddie pool\, a trail of bubbles and a crowd of babes. Want to join the fun
  and get an absolutely stunnin’ t-shirt designed by @designbycma ? Sign 
 up to be one of our contestants through the link in bio on instagram! Doll
 z+Dogs is exclusive to folks under the trans umbrella\, BIPOC prioritized.
  All queer folks are welcome to come watch and support. Lez Beach is first
  and foremost a grassroots gathering to combat rising levels of harassment
  and exclusion towards lesbians in queer spaces. Hanlan’s Point Beach is
  a public\, clothing optional space and we cannot control who can and who 
 cannot enter the space during Lez Beach. If you have concerns about the cr
 owd\, please come sit with us at the entrance to the event! We keep each o
 ther safe. If you’ve never attended before\, take a look at @lezbeach 
 ’s FAQ posts! This is a gathering to encourage safety and reclaim space 
 for sapphics in the queer community. There is zero tolerance for racism\, 
 transphobia\, fatphobia or misogyny. If you do not connect to the sapphic 
 experience\, we ask you to reconsider the space you’re entering. Dollz+D
 ogz artwork by @designbycma Poster by @sapphics_raise_the_bar Map by @azay
 drea Saturday\, August 29th 6:00pm Hanlans Point Beach Between trail 3 &am
 p\; 4 Tkaronto\, ON . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . #hanlanspoint #transev
 ents #sapphicevents #queerevents #wettshirtcontest ‍
LOCATION:Hanlan&#x27\;s Point Beach\, Toronto Islands
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/dollz-dogz-a-wet-t4t-shirt-contest
